go 1.27.1

// The remaining GoDFIR-toolz Go modules. Each is its own module (own go.mod).
// gowindowlicker, godaemonhunter, gomount and the shared pinfo module have been
// retired from this repo: the container images now import those tools from their
// published modules (github.com/Get-Sybers/<tool>) at build time via `go install`
// (see each tool's Dockerfile), so no Go source for them lives here. signatures
// and zeek remain until they get their own standalone repos; signatures/goyara
// needs libyara (CGO) and builds where the library is present (CI).
use (
	./signatures
	./signatures/goyara
	./zeek
)
